    <section class="manifesto chapter" id="signal" data-chapter="02 / 04" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
      <div class="section-shell">
        <div class="section-index" data-reveal>01 / INFORMATION ADVANTAGE</div>
        <div class="manifesto__grid">
          <div class="manifesto__headline" data-reveal>
            <p>THE RACE IS DECIDED IN THE DISTANCE BETWEEN</p>
            <h2 id="manifesto-title">SIGNAL<br><span>AND ACTION.</span></h2>
          </div>
          <div class="manifesto__copy" data-reveal>
            <p class="lead">A Formula 1 car produces no shortage of information. The advantage is shortening the path from a changing condition to a coordinated engineering decision.</p>
            <p>One race state. High-fidelity technical applications. Predictable access for specialists at the circuit, factory and beyond.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="signal-line" data-reveal aria-label="Race intelligence decision sequence">
          <article>
            <span class="signal-line__number">01</span>
            <div class="signal-line__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
            <small>CAPTURE</small>
            <h3>The car speaks in systems.</h3>
            <p>Suspension displacement, tyre energy, aerodynamic balance and thermal state become one changing model.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="signal-line__number">02</span>
            <div class="signal-line__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
            <small>RESOLVE</small>
            <h3>The model removes ambiguity.</h3>
            <p>Every engineer sees the same evidence at the same moment, without reconciling disconnected versions of truth.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="signal-line__number">03</span>
            <div class="signal-line__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
            <small>ACT</small>
            <h3>The answer arrives before the corner.</h3>
            <p>Responsive access converts analysis into setup, strategy and intervention while the opportunity still exists.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="operations chapter" id="operations" data-chapter="03 / 04" aria-labelledby="operations-title">
      <div class="section-shell operations__shell">
