          <h2 id="operations-title" data-reveal>ONE LAP.<br><span>ONE DECISION STATE.</span></h2>
          <p data-reveal>Five distributed teams read the same race, but each one needs a different slice of the model. The advantage is keeping those perspectives synchronized under pressure.</p>
